              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                For most people, the best mattress is a medium-firm bed with a long trial, and the Nectar Classic 12-inch memory foam mattress fits that best on Amazon, with a 365-night trial and lifetime warranty stated by Nectar. Couples and hot sleepers may prefer the Casper Original Hybrid or the Purple Mattress, and budget shoppers the Zinus Green Tea.
